{"id":"18.4.3","doc":"T","title":"Message Digest","words":268,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"After the hash task completes, the "},{"t":"block","v":"SHA","id":"crypto"},{"t":"text","v":" accelerator writes the message digest from the task to registers SHA_H_n_REG (n: 0~15)."}]},{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The lengths of the generated message digest are different depending on different hash algorithms."}]},{"n":3,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"For details, see Table 18.4-4 below:"}]}]},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 18.4-4. The Storage and Length of Message digest from Different Algorithms","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"Hash Algorithm"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Length of Message Digest (in bits)"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Storage [1]"}]],"rows":[{"n":4,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"SHA-1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"160"}],[{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_0_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" ~ "},{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_4_REG"}]]},{"n":5,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"SHA-224"}],[{"t":"text","v":"224"}],[{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_0_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" ~ "},{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_6_REG"}]]},{"n":6,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"SHA-256"}],[{"t":"text","v":"256"}],[{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_0_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" ~ "},{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_7_REG"}]]},{"n":7,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"SHA-384"}],[{"t":"text","v":"384"}],[{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_0_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" ~ "},{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_11_REG"}]]},{"n":8,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"SHA-512"}],[{"t":"text","v":"512"}],[{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_0_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" ~ "},{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_15_REG"}]]},{"n":9,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"SHA-512/224"}],[{"t":"text","v":"224"}],[{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_0_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" ~ "},{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_6_REG"}]]},{"n":10,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"SHA-512/256"}],[{"t":"text","v":"256"}],[{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_0_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" ~ "},{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_7_REG"}]]},{"n":11,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"SHA-512/t [2]"}],[{"t":"text","v":"t"}],[{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_0_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" ~ SHA_H_x_REG"}]]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":12,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"[1] The message digest are stored in registers from most significant bits to the least significant bits, with the first word stored in register "},{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_0_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" and the second word stored in register "},{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_1_REG"},{"t":"text","v":"..."}]},{"n":13,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"For details, please see subsection "},{"t":"xref","id":"18.4.1.2","c":[{"t":"text","v":"18.4.1.2"}]},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":14,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"[2] The registers used for SHA-512/t algorithm depend on the value of t. x+1 indicates the number of "},{"t":"num","v":"32-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" registers used to store t bits of message digest, so that x = roundup(t/32) - 1."}]},{"n":15,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"For example:"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":16,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"When t = 8, then x = 0, indicating that the "},{"t":"num","v":"8-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" long message digest is stored in the most significant 8 bits of register "},{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_0_REG"},{"t":"text","v":";"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":17,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"When t = 32, then x = 0, indicating that the "},{"t":"num","v":"32-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" long message digest is stored in register "},{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_0_REG"},{"t":"text","v":";"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":18,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"When t = 132, then x = 4, indicating that the "},{"t":"num","v":"132-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" long message digest is stored in registers "},{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_0_REG"},{"t":"text","v":", "},{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_1_REG"},{"t":"text","v":", "},{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_2_REG"},{"t":"text","v":", "},{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_3_REG"},{"t":"text","v":", and "},{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_H_4_REG"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}]]}]}